Remove timescaledb from requirements.txt; it is actually the PostgreSQL extension, not a Python (PyPI) package.
Summary:
TimescaleDB = PostgreSQL extension (install separately)

psycopg2-binary = Python connector to PostgreSQL/TimescaleDB

Remove timescaledb from your Python requirements

The psycopg2-binary package is what you'll use to connect to your TimescaleDB database from Python.